<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>O Lord, now I realize,</l><l>Today I am being energized.</l><l>Your word has come to give light and life,</l><l>Freed me from my struggle and strife.</l><l>Lord, feed me, supply me, grow in me,</l><l>As You become everything to me.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
